0015:     Complete the bounding rectangle around an incomplete teal shape by filling its missing cells red.
0016: 
0017:     Input structure:
0018:     - The input is a black grid containing an incomplete teal rectangle.
0019:     - The teal pixels define the intended rectangle's bounding box.
0020:     - Black pixels inside that bounding box are missing rectangle cells.
0021: 
0022:     Rule:
0023:     - Find the bounding box of all non-black pixels.
0024:     - Replace black cells inside that box with red while preserving teal cells.
0025:     - Paste the completed rectangle back into the original grid.
